GerClaw account-private library provider

Derived from dsh-library 0.1.3 (Apache-2.0):
https://github.com/PerryLink/dsh-library/tree/0.1.3

GerClaw retains LibraryStore, configuration, chunking, embedding and retrieval
logic. It removes the upstream command and Tool registration surface and
publishes the store through a replaceable Cordis Service instead. Storage is
provided by the DSH Loader composition and is never instantiated here.
